        <div class="wrap">
          <h2>User Research</h2>
          <p>I paired a survey (20+ responses) with interviews of people who either have a disability or frequently travel with someone who does, combining quantitative reach with qualitative depth. Their feedback highlighted common frustrations around inaccessible pathways and the lack of reliable information when planning routes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="image-row-single image-row-single-wide">
